        "Description": "A usually quiet town, known as Whittleton Creek, has become known as the &apos;ghost-with-unfinished-business-and-intent-to-kill town&apos;,  how did all these freak accidents occur? Could it have been a supernatural force? How did this story reach its conclusion?",
